{% comment %}
  Predictive search input — rendered from the <search-drawer> template inside
  sections/main-nav.liquid (2026-10-10 刘工: the header row shows an icon only;
  the full form lives in the right-side drawer).

  Split from sections/predictive-search.liquid on purpose: a section cannot be
  rendered into another file, but a snippet can. main-nav owns the drawer, so
  the input lives here, while the RESULTS markup lives in the section — that
  file must stand alone because Shopify re-renders it by section_id
  (`section_id=predictive-search` targets the section FILE name).

  Parameters:
    search_section_id — used for input/panel id pairing (unique per section).
    results_limit     — forwarded as data-results-limit for the JS fetch.

  ARIA: the input keeps its combobox + listbox pattern INSIDE the drawer. The
  drawer itself is a modal <dialog>, but the combobox behaviour is unchanged:
  DOM focus stays in the input; arrow keys move a virtual cursor via
  aria-activedescendant. Escape is left to bubble when the results panel is
  closed, so it closes the drawer (layered dismiss: panel → drawer).

  Progressive enhancement baseline: action points at the real search URL, so with JS
  disabled the form still searches. The script only enhances it.
{% endcomment %}

  <predictive-search
    class="predictive-search"
    data-results-limit="{{ results_limit | default: 10 }}"
  >
    <form
      class="predictive-search__form"
      action="{{ routes.search_url }}"
      method="get"
      role="search"
    >
    <label class="visually-hidden" for="search-input-{{ search_section_id }}">
      {{ 'search.label' | t }}
    </label>

    {%- comment -%}
      输入区：放大镜（左）、输入框、清空按钮（右）与加载扫描线都锚定在
      这个相对定位的 field 上——form 自身改为纵向 flex 后，
      它的底边不再是"输入框下沿"，扫描线必须跟着 field 走。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="predictive-search__field">
      {%- comment -%}
        放大镜：纯视觉图标（aria-hidden + tabindex="-1"），可访问入口是输入框
        本身（combobox 语义）。
        清空按钮恢复（2026-10-10 刘工）：type=search 的原生 WebKit 清除 X
        无法定制样式，隐藏之，用与抽屉右上角关闭键同款的自定义按钮替代。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button
        type="button"
        class="predictive-search__submit"
        data-predictive-search-submit
        aria-hidden="true"
        tabindex="-1"
      >
        {{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
        <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'search.submit' | t }}</span>
      </button>

      <input
        id="search-input-{{ search_section_id }}"
        class="predictive-search__input"
        type="search"
        name="q"
        value="{{ search.terms | escape }}"
        placeholder="{{ 'search.placeholder' | t | escape }}"
        autocomplete="off"
        autocorrect="off"
        autocapitalize="off"
        spellcheck="false"
        role="combobox"
        aria-expanded="false"
        aria-controls="predictive-search-results-{{ search_section_id }}"
        aria-autocomplete="list"
        aria-describedby="predictive-search-help-{{ search_section_id }}"
      >

      {%- comment -%}
        清空输入：显隐由 JS 用 hidden 属性驱动（无输入时彻底离开无障碍树）。
        样式与抽屉右上角关闭键同款（2026-10-10 刘工）。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button
        type="button"
        class="predictive-search__clear"
        aria-label="{{ 'search.clear' | t }}"
        data-predictive-search-clear
        hidden
      >
        {{ 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
      </button>
    </div>

    <button type="submit" class="visually-hidden">
      {{ 'search.submit' | t }}
    </button>

    {%- comment -%}
      说明键盘操作方式。无结果时也保留——它解释的是控件行为，不是结果内容。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p id="predictive-search-help-{{ search_section_id }}" class="visually-hidden">
      {{ 'search.instructions' | t }}
    </p>

    {%- comment -%}
      结果容器由 JS 注入 HTML 片段。aria-controls 指向这个 id，
      JS 注入内容时复用同一个 id。不再是浮层：作为 flex 子项吃满
      dialog 剩余高度，滚动条只出现在列表上（2026-10-10 刘工）。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div
      class="predictive-search__panel"
      id="predictive-search-results-{{ search_section_id }}"
      hidden
    ></div>
  </form>
</predictive-search>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* 视觉基调（2026-10-10 刘工：极简 / 高端 / 沉浸式 / 工业力量感）：
     输入框去边框只留发丝底线，聚焦换品牌色；加载用一条细扫描线。 */
  .predictive-search {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    inline-size: 100%;
  }

  .predictive-search__form {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .predictive-search__submit {
    position: absolute;
    inset-inline-start: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8） */
    inline-size: 44px;
    block-size: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    /* 图标压在输入框左侧，输入框留出等宽内边距 */
    inset-block-start: 50%;
    translate: 0 -50%;
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 45%);
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    pointer-events: none; /* 点击穿透到输入框：它只是视觉图标 */
  }

  .predictive-search__submit svg {
    inline-size: 1.25rem;
    block-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .predictive-search__input {
    inline-size: 100%;
    /* 触摸目标 ≥ 44×44（AGENTS §8） */
    min-block-size: 48px;
    padding: 0.625rem 2.75rem 0.625rem 2.75rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    /* 极简线型：无框，只有发丝底线；聚焦换品牌色加粗 */
    border: 0;
    border-block-end: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 25%);
    border-radius: 0;
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    appearance: none;
  }

  /* 原生 WebKit search 清除 X 无法定制，隐藏——用下方自定义清空按钮替代 */
  .predictive-search__input::-webkit-search-cancel-button,
  .predictive-search__input::-webkit-search-decoration {
    -webkit-appearance: none;
    appearance: none;
  }

  .predictive-search__input::placeholder {
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 40%);
  }

  /* 焦点指示：底线由灰转品牌色并加粗（可见变化，替代外框 outline）。
     outline: none 是刻意的——线型输入框外框 outline 破坏极简基调，
     且底线变化满足 WCAG 2.1「焦点位置可见」要求（SDD §8.2）。 */
  .predictive-search__input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-block-end: 2px solid var(--color-brand-accent);
    padding-block-end: calc(0.625rem - 1px);
  }

  /* ---- 加载扫描线：请求进行中，输入框下沿一条细线往返 ----
     aria-busy 由 JS 在请求生命周期内驱动（过期的请求不会误关）。 */
  .predictive-search__form::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-end: 0;
    inset-inline-start: 0;
    inline-size: 35%;
    block-size: 2px;
    background-color: var(--color-brand-accent);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .predictive-search[aria-busy='true'] .predictive-search__form::after {
    opacity: 1;
    animation: predictive-search-sweep 0.9s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes predictive-search-sweep {
    0% {
      translate: 0 0;
    }
    50% {
      translate: 186% 0;
    }
    100% {
      translate: 0 0;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .predictive-search[aria-busy='true'] .predictive-search__form::after {
      animation: none;
      inline-size: 100%;
      opacity: 0.4;
    }
  }

  /* 结果面板：沉浸式——与抽屉同底色、无框无圆角，分区靠发丝线（见 section 样式） */
  /* 清空按钮：与抽屉右上角关闭键（.search-drawer__close）同款 */
  .predictive-search__clear {
    position: absolute;
    inset-inline-end: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    inline-size: 44px;
    block-size: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    color: inherit;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* 无输入时隐藏（JS 用 hidden 属性控制，此处兜底初始态） */
  .predictive-search__clear[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .predictive-search__clear svg {
    inline-size: 1.25rem;
    block-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .predictive-search__clear:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid currentColor;
    outline-offset: -2px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .predictive-search__panel {
    position: absolute;
    inset-block-start: calc(100% + 0.5rem);
    inset-inline: 0;
    z-index: 30;
    max-block-size: min(65vh, 40rem);
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }

  .predictive-search__panel[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
